# CSS

Use the existing `:root` tokens. Do not add a second palette, font stack, or design system.

```css
--ink, --muted, --line, --paper, --soft,
--accent, --accent-strong, --roof, --ok,
--shadow, --radius
```

- Shared width: `min(1180px, calc(100% - 36px))` via `.section-inner` and friends.
- Sticky header, topbar, service nav, and sticky mobile CTA are load-bearing. Don't remove them to "clean up" the layout.
- Prefer extending existing classes (`.btn`, `.card`, `.section`, `.grid`) over new one-off components.
- Keep the stylesheet vanilla CSS. No Tailwind, no CSS-in-JS, no extra preprocessor.
